# alpha-site runs no Garage node: the geo-distributed cluster is exactly
# celestia + luna + skystar (replication_factor 3, one copy per machine), and
# this host has neither a /data ZFS array mount nor a postgres consumer that
# needs the mirror. Deleting this file would deploy a fourth node with no
# layout role and a failing init.sh. See docker/_common/garage/compose.yaml.
